cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Numerical companion to: A Static Axisymmetric Deformation of Nariai Geometry"
abstract: >-
  Scripts reproducing the numerical results of the paper "A Static Axisymmetric
  Deformation of Nariai Geometry: Nonround Horizons without Rotation or Conical
  Defects": the energy-condition threshold lambda_c = 0.363619247... and the
  horizon-geometry figure.
type: software
